 like this uh  support them because they always need  funding right  the project you know i'd love to expand  this project down into mexico where  where douglas first southern limit but  we can't work just in canada  because that's only where our funding is  from and we only have limited funding  so you could you know invest in projects  like this that span  much bigger latitudinal gradients and  you know you can donate to projects like  this if you want  right well and hopefully even projects  that uh span great  temporal gradients so yes thank you for  working on this it's been amazing to  talk with you  uh and i can't wait to follow your work  brother thank you so much  thank you so much for having me  and i'd like to thank you our audience  and members and sponsors here at long  now this has been great and we look  forward to seeing you  at the next talk be well  [Music]

